# _headers — extra security instructions Cloudflare Pages sends with every page.
# Why it exists: tells browsers how to treat the dashboard safely.
#   X-Frame-Options / frame-ancestors: never show this site inside another website
#     (blocks "clickjacking" — a fake page hiding our sign-in under its own buttons).
#   Referrer-Policy: when a link leads elsewhere, only share our site name, not full addresses.
#   Permissions-Policy: the dashboard never needs the camera, microphone or location.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
